    {
      "unique_index": 0,
      "cn_text": "喂，Snake。我最近一直在想……格瓦拉到头来，是不是也没能在战场之外找到自己的容身之处。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 125,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 1,
      "cn_text": "什么意思？",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 15,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 2,
      "cn_text": "格瓦拉完成了古巴革命。那是伟大的战果。就算他就此安享成果，也没人会责怪他。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 111,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OMITS_NO_BLAME_CLAUSE"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 3,
      "cn_text": "可格瓦拉却抛下温暖的家庭和部长之位，投身革命战场。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 75,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 4,
      "cn_text": "刚果。然后是玻利维亚。那里成了他生命的终点。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 66,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 5,
      "cn_text": "你想多了。格瓦拉再次奔赴战场，是因为那里需要他。读读《告别信》就明白了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 108,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 6,
      "cn_text": "也有人说，他太过理想主义，在政府里待不下去了。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 69,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 7,
      "cn_text": "大概是因为他太过清高吧。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 36,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 8,
      "cn_text": "话是这么说……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 21,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 9,
      "cn_text": "我只是觉得，我和你之所以会被格瓦拉吸引，或许是因为从他身上感觉到了和自己相似的气息……仅此而已。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 144,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 10,
      "cn_text": "离开祖国投身战斗，辗转于需要自己的战场……",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 63,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_OMITS_WANDERING_BATTLEFIELDS"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 11,
      "cn_text": "格瓦拉与其说是战士，不如说是革命家。他为了实现理想而拿起枪。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 90,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_WEAKENS_COMPARATIVE_CORRECTED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 12,
      "cn_text": "我不为思想而战。我是<R=　战士　,war fighter>。仅此而已，不多不少。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "<R=　战士　,war fighter>",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 91,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;RUBY_LOCALIZED;SOURCE_FULLWIDTH_SPACES_PRESERVED"
    },
    {
      "unique_index": 13,
      "cn_text": "明白了，Boss。你说得对。我只是想在那位伟大英雄身上找找自己的影子而已。",
      "cn_control_tokens": "",
      "cn_utf8_bytes": 103,
      "review_flag": "JPN_DIRECT_TRANSLATION;AUX_PARAPHRASE_CORRECTED"
    }
  ]
}
